  "description": "There are countless records of Eze's prowess in battle, but few touch on the subject of his suitability as a leader. Of these scant materials, the overwhelming majority are skeptical, to say the least. Only Weiss is quoted as vouching for Eze, \"A leader doesn't need to think, if they can sense danger and quickly take action that will inspire their followers.\" If the Six HeroesSix Heroes had succeeded in repelling the gods, perhaps we would have witnessed the unlikely sight of Eze parading alongside respected generals and tacticians.",
  "summon": "I'm not good at getting ordered around. The only thing I do worse is losing! So why waste time listening?",
  "fusion": "I wonder what my friends would say if they could see what I've become! Imagine the looks on their faces...!",
  "evolution": "I couldn't care less about your plan! Leave everything to me, and no matter what happens, I'll make sure it goes your way!",
